    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d314">

                <pb facs="0526" n="240" xml:id="pg240"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/2614</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Germany</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                    >Gerard</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Berlin</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-04-22T20:00:00+01:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 22, 1916, 8 p. m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received April 23, 3.20 p.
                        m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>3790. On account of Easter holidays rendering consultation of Government with
                    prominent public and business men difficult, think reply of Germany will not
                    come for some time. Think German Government quite surprised by strength of
                    proofs of torpedoing of <hi rendition="#italic">Sussex</hi>.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Gerard</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
